  "solution": "<ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li>Tập xác định của hàm số là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝒟</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>ℝ</mi><mo>\\</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">}</mo></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Do đó hàm số đã cho liên tục tại điểm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Hàm số không liên tục trên các khoảng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>∞</mi><mo>;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>∞</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> vì hàm số không liên tục tại điểm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><munder><mo>lim</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><munder><mo>lim</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>⇒</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow><mo>⇒</mo><munder><mo>lim</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>∞</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mo>lim</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munder><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">]</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>lim</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munder><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>∞</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.</li></ol>",
